# AI_CONTEXT continuity (QuantLab) v1.1

```text
DERIVED_CONTEXT=YES
CANONICAL_AUTHORITY=NO
Repo > docs/governance/** > AI_CONTEXT/ > chat
SELF_REFERENTIAL_HEAD_REFRESH=DENY
CURRENT_REPO_HEAD=RUNTIME_DERIVED
```

## Bootstrap

Read `AI_CONTEXT/BOOTSTRAP.md` first. Derive `CURRENT_REPO_HEAD` via `git rev-parse HEAD`. AI_CONTEXT-only diffs since `CONTEXT_BASE_HEAD` are not auto-stale.

## When to update

Material only: phase/gate, P0/P1, Owner Gate, capability/flag/runtime/deploy, architecture/HOLD, failure/RCA, iteration close.

**Never** commit solely to bump a stored HEAD field.

## When not to update

Trivial edits, cosmetic commits, log dumps, timestamp-only bumps, self-referential HEAD equality.

## Hard forbids

- Chat / CoT in AI_CONTEXT  
- Parallel SSOT / Constitution copies  
- Stale handoff overriding canonical  
- Infinite HEAD-refresh loops
